# --- Private development area (never public) ---------------------------------
# Real-vault golden question sets, their drafts, recorded evaluation runs
# (they embed queries, page paths and section titles from the personal
# vault), and release scratch (announcement drafts, index entry, upstream
# patches in flight). The public repo keeps the harness, the schema, the
# synthetic sample set, generated benchmark tables and the recorded gate
# decisions in docs/evaluation.md.
private/
evals/runs/*
!evals/runs/.gitkeep

